State 0

    0 $accept: • program $end

    LIST_T  shift, and go to state 1
    ID_T    shift, and go to state 2
    '-'     shift, and go to state 3
    '{'     shift, and go to state 4
    '('     shift, and go to state 5

    program  go to state 6
